WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.127 --> 00:00:03.795
- March 2020...

00:00:04.963 --> 00:00:08.383
A deadly virus sweeps around the world.

00:00:08.926 --> 00:00:12.846
Overnight, our lives
are put on pause.

00:00:14.014 --> 00:00:16.725
- Today, the WHO declared a pandemic...

00:00:16.808 --> 00:00:19.144
- ...issuing a stay home, stay safe order.

00:00:19.228 --> 00:00:23.357
- ...directing all of our residents
to quite simply stay at home.

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:25.984
(uplifting music plays)

00:00:26.944 --> 00:00:28.904
- But as we stop,

00:00:28.987 --> 00:00:33.116
remarkable things start
to change in the natural world.

00:00:36.161 --> 00:00:38.914
- With the clear skies,
for the first time in a lifetime,

00:00:38.997 --> 00:00:40.791
we can see the Himalayas.

00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:41.542
(camera shutter clicks)

00:00:43.377 --> 00:00:46.004
- With beaches closed to humans,
these animals

00:00:46.088 --> 00:00:49.007
were nesting at a more successful rate
than we've ever seen.

00:00:49.091 --> 00:00:50.467
(whales singing)

00:00:50.551 --> 00:00:53.178
- One vocalizing, and than the other...
I'd never heard that before.

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:59.726
- From the start of lockdown,
across five continents,

00:00:59.810 --> 00:01:05.232
we have recorded a global experiment
of epic proportions

00:01:05.315 --> 00:01:07.901
that has shown us
if we choose,

00:01:07.985 --> 00:01:10.070
we can transform
the health of the planet...

00:01:11.905 --> 00:01:13.407
...for all.

